    <string name="eq_unavailable_offload">Audio processing is unavailable while Bluetooth A2DP hardware offload is enabled. The note in the device list explains how to turn it off.</string>
    <string name="eq_unavailable_hook_old">Audio processing is unavailable: the module running in the Bluetooth process is an older version that does not know about it. Turn Bluetooth off, then on again.</string>

